    "照片读取相机记录的拍摄时间；没有记录的按创建时间。同一秒的会自动加 _2。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Photos use the capture time recorded by the camera, or the creation date if there isn’t one. Files from the same second get _2 added."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "照片读取相机记录的拍摄时间；没有记录的按创建时间。同一秒的会自动加 _2。"
          }
        }
